WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Standing medium punch starts the corner confirm.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.800
OD Spinning Bird Kick launches Ryu beside the wall.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.300
The first Yosokyaku stomp connects.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.300
A delayed second stomp keeps Ryu at the required juggle height.

5
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.950
Jumping heavy punch and its follow-up end the juggle.

6
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.400
Chun-Li jumps forward again and attacks over the knockdown.

7
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.300
Chun-Li lands in time to guard Ryu’s gold OD Shoryuken.

8
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:07.950
Ryu lands after the blocked wake-up reversal.
